---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert ContractPaused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_published: not paused
    q_check_published --> q_verify_proof: results published
    q_check_published --> q_revert_published: results not published
    q_revert_published --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_verify_proof --> q_check_claimed_excess: merkleProof valid for (investor, acceptedCapital)
    q_verify_proof --> q_revert_proof: invalid proof
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof
    q_check_claimed_excess --> q_calculate: excessCapital not already claimed
    q_check_claimed_excess --> q_revert_claimed: already claimed excess
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert ExcessAlreadyClaimed
    q_calculate --> q_check_positive: excessAmount = totalInvested - acceptedCapital
    q_check_positive --> q_transfer: excessAmount > 0
    q_check_positive --> q_revert_zero: excessAmount == 0
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert NoExcessCapital
    q_transfer --> q_update_state: transfer excessAmount of bidToken to investor
    q_update_state --> q_emit: investorPosition.excessClaimed = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn(investor, excessAmount)

    note right of q_calculate
        INV-001: Excess = totalInvested - acceptedCapital (Merkle-verified)
        INV-002: Each investor claims excess at most once
        INV-003: Merkle proof validates accepted capital amount
        INV-004: Only callable after results publication
    end note
